# Copy to backend/.env for local development, or set these as environment
# variables in Render's dashboard for deployment. Never commit the real
# values — this file is just a template.

# Password for /admin — required. Pick something you wouldn't mind a
# reasonably determined stranger guessing, since there's currently no
# rate-limiting or lockout on login attempts.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-before-deploying

# Only needed if you've attached a Render persistent disk (see render.yaml).
# Leave unset for local development.
# DATA_DIR=/data

# --- Email notifications (optional) ---------------------------------------
# Powers two things: booking-confirmation emails to customers, and new-request
# alert emails to staff. Both are optional — the app works fine without them,
# it just falls back to the WhatsApp deep-link flow instead of emailing.
#
# Setup (takes ~2 minutes):
#   1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on the Gmail account you want to send
#      from: myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Generate an App Password: myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#      (only appears once 2-Step Verification is on). Choose "Mail" as the
#      app. Copy the 16-character password it gives you.
#   3. Set GMAIL_USER to the full Gmail address, and GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD to
#      that 16-character password (not your normal Gmail password).
#
# GMAIL_USER=bookings@kileletours.co.ke
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-app-password

# Where new-request staff alerts go. Optional — defaults to GMAIL_USER
# (i.e. the same inbox you're sending from) if not set.
# ADMIN_ALERT_EMAIL=staff@kileletours.co.ke
